{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally in New York"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Cultural Landmark"}, {"type": "position", "content": 8}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Famous Structures > The Empire State Building"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 13}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about travel and vacations in social situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le13ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "eye-opener"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something surprising "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The NY Stock Exchange was a real eye-opener."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le13ob08aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you write about New York."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bell"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a cup-shaped metal object that makes a ringing sound when it is hit"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They rang the bell at the start of the day."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le13ob08aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "maze"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "many connected passages"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He took us through a maze of offices."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le13ob08aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "data"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "facts or information used to calculate, analyze, or plan something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There was a lot of data on the screens."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le13ob08aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "a must-see"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something  that must or should be seen"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You should watch them work. It's a must-see!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le13ob08aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "stock exchange"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a place where shares of a company are bought and sold"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We went to the New York Stock Exchange."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le13ob08aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to invest"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to use your money to purchase stock in a company"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to invest my money in shares."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le13ob08aud07"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Writing About A City And Its Landmarks"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "To write a descriptive paragraph about a landmark you include the following about the landmark:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  <ul>  \t<li>Name and location<br/> Example: <span class=\"italic\">The New York Stock Exchange is located downtown.</span></li>    <li>Who designed it, when it was built <br/> (use the <span class=\"strong\">Simple Past</span> tense) </li>  \t  Example: <span class=\"italic\">It was built in 1817; the group Intercontinental Exchange started the construction.</span>  <li>A description of the interior and exterior<br/>   Example: <span class=\"italic\">It has an amazing view; there's a lot of noise; you see large rooms in it; it's one of the tallest buildings in Manhattan. </span>  </li>  \t  <li>Interesting facts <br/>  Example: <span class=\"italic\">They ring a bell to start and finish the day.</span></li>    <li>Your opinion (what did you think about the landmark?) <br/>  Example: <span class=\"italic\"> This building is impressive, it's a total eye-opener!</span></li>    </ul>"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go online and research a landmark anywhere in the world."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Complete the table below."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Present the information to your class or a partner."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Name of landmark:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What is it?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Who built the landmark?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"When was it built?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Is the landmark natural (like the Grand Canyon) or human-made (like the Eiffel Tower)?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What is special or important about it? \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Interesting fact(s)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I identify landmarks on the internet."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I organize my research into a table."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I present my research to my class or my partner."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le13ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le13ob08re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn4le13ob08re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "Hey Peter,<br /><br />Let me tell you about yesterday. I was on Wall Street! I feel on top of the world!", "id": 1, "time": "10", "image": "engenn4le13ob08re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "The concierge at the hotel said we had to go on a tour of the New York Stock Exchange. I didn't realize that it was a National Historic Landmark.  It was a real eye-opener. We arrived in time to hear the opening bell that marks the beginning of each trading day.", "id": 2, "time": "9000", "image": "engenn4le13ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "A broker then  led the tour group through a maze of offices onto the trading floor. We could see the big television screens with data above us. The brokers were busy shouting and waving their arms across the room.", "id": 3, "time": "27000", "image": "engenn4le13ob08re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "They were busy buying and selling shares. Anyone visiting New York should spend a few hours watching these people work. It's a must-see! I still don't understand how people can work with all that noise!<br /><br />Sal", "id": 4, "time": "42000", "image": "engenn4le13ob08re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "I'm off to see the Empire State Building.<br />\nTake care<br />", "id": 5, "time": "57500", "image": "engenn4le13ob08re2img05.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn4le13ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class = \"bullet\">How to write about landmarks</span>", "id": 1, "time": "5000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class = \"bullet\">What you do do first? Time to research!</span>", "id": 2, "time": "16000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class = \"bullet\">Let's organize the information</span>", "id": 3, "time": "103000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class = \"bullet\">What should you remember to do?</span>", "id": 4, "time": "128000", "image": ""}]}}]}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Listening"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Vocabulary and Grammar"}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can write about places in a city."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content